---
/**
 * /iscrizioni/grazie — where a completed membership payment lands.
 *
 * Stripe can show its own confirmation, but a member who has just paid should
 * come back to the club's site rather than end on a payment processor's page.
 * Set this URL as the Payment Link's "after payment" redirect — the runbook is
 * docs/payments.md.
 *
 * It says nothing about *which* tier was bought and reads no query string on
 * purpose: `?session_id=` is a Stripe identifier, and nothing here should be
 * built on a value a visitor can edit in the address bar. The receipt is the
 * email Stripe sends; the record is the Sheet.
 */
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Grazie!"
  description="Il pagamento è stato ricevuto dal Parapendio Club Ventorelativo."
  breadcrumbLabels={{ '/iscrizioni': 'Iscrizioni' }}
  noindex
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Il pagamento è stato ricevuto e la ricevuta ti arriverà per email. Il direttivo
      registra le nuove iscrizioni a mano, quindi possono passare qualche giorno prima
      della conferma.
    </p>
    <p>
      Se qualcosa non torna, <a href="/contatti">scrivici</a>.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/">Torna alla home</a></p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
